00:17:34.420 --> 00:17:35.300
Gráficos personalizados

00:17:35.300 --> 00:17:35.960
de alto rendimiento

00:17:35.960 --> 00:17:36.680
o animaciones complejas

00:17:36.680 --> 00:17:37.280
probablemente no.

00:17:37.860 --> 00:17:38.720
Power Apps es una herramienta

00:17:38.720 --> 00:17:39.120
de negocios,

00:17:39.200 --> 00:17:39.740
no un motor de web.

00:17:40.280 --> 00:17:41.120
Comparemos con el Terentive.

00:17:41.740 --> 00:17:42.500
Existen herramientas

00:17:42.500 --> 00:17:42.900
sin código

00:17:42.900 --> 00:17:43.520
