00:17:47.460 --> 00:17:48.320
pero les falta

00:17:48.320 --> 00:17:48.920
lo que hace especial

00:17:48.920 --> 00:17:49.440
a Power Apps.

00:17:50.100 --> 00:17:50.960
La seguridad de datos

00:17:50.960 --> 00:17:51.480
de Microsoft,

00:17:51.800 --> 00:17:52.760
la integración del ecosistema

00:17:52.760 --> 00:17:53.320
con Teams,

00:17:53.820 --> 00:17:54.640
SharePoint y Outlook,

00:17:55.100 --> 00:17:55.660
